{"id":"sample_a2-eg-ramen","videoId":"q4PkX8_xUYk","title":"Everyday Grammar Video: Ramen, A Popular Food in Japan","author":"VOA Learning English","videoDuration":121000,"lang":"en","transcriptHash":"ed9171a15256ce089c4326378d82d3b4","source":"supadata","start":0,"end":120000,"sentences":[{"id":"s0_7100","text":"Hi, Dr. Jill.","words":[{"w":"Hi,","start":7100,"end":7468},{"w":"Dr.","start":7468,"end":7837},{"w":"Jill.","start":7837,"end":8389}],"start":7100,"end":8389,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,1],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"こんにちは、ジル博士。","edge":false,"segFrom":0,"segTo":0},{"id":"s2_8389","text":"Hi, John.","words":[{"w":"Hi,","start":8389,"end":8757},{"w":"John.","start":8757,"end":9310}],"start":8389,"end":9310,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,1],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"こんにちは、ジョン","edge":false,"segFrom":0,"segTo":0},{"id":"s3_9310","text":"What's on your mind today?","words":[{"w":"What's","start":9310,"end":9954},{"w":"on","start":9954,"end":10230},{"w":"your","start":10230,"end":10690},{"w":"mind","start":10690,"end":11151},{"w":"today?","start":11151,"end":11795}],"start":9310,"end":11795,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,1,4],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"今日はどんなことが気になっていますか？","edge":false,"segFrom":0,"segTo":0},{"id":"s4_11795","text":"We received a lot of messages from our audience around the world.","words":[{"w":"We","start":11795,"end":12071},{"w":"received","start":12071,"end":12900},{"w":"a","start":12900,"end":13041},{"w":"lot","start":13041,"end":13324},{"w":"of","start":13324,"end":13536},{"w":"messages","start":13536,"end":14171},{"w":"from","start":14171,"end":14525},{"w":"our","start":14525,"end":14807},{"w":"audience","start":14807,"end":15443},{"w":"around","start":15443,"end":15937},{"w":"the","start":15937,"end":16220},{"w":"world.","start":16220,"end":16714}],"start":11795,"end":16714,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,6,9],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私たちは世界中の視聴者からたくさんのメッセージを受け取りました。","edge":false,"segFrom":0,"segTo":1},{"id":"s5_16714","text":"One unnamed VOA Learning English fan sent us a message from Japan.","words":[{"w":"One","start":16714,"end":16997},{"w":"unnamed","start":16997,"end":17562},{"w":"VOA","start":17562,"end":17844},{"w":"Learning","start":17844,"end":18480},{"w":"English","start":18480,"end":19275},{"w":"fan","start":19275,"end":19672},{"w":"sent","start":19672,"end":20169},{"w":"us","start":20169,"end":20467},{"w":"a","start":20467,"end":20665},{"w":"message","start":20665,"end":21460},{"w":"from","start":21460,"end":21957},{"w":"Japan.","start":21957,"end":22652}],"start":16714,"end":22652,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,6,8,10],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"VOA Learning Englishのファンの一人が日本からメッセージを送ってくれました。","edge":false,"segFrom":1,"segTo":2},{"id":"s6_22652","text":"Most popular food in Japan is ramen.","words":[{"w":"Most","start":22652,"end":23149},{"w":"popular","start":23149,"end":23943},{"w":"food","start":23943,"end":24440},{"w":"in","start":24440,"end":24690},{"w":"Japan","start":24690,"end":25190},{"w":"is","start":25190,"end":25440},{"w":"ramen.","start":25440,"end":26023}],"start":22652,"end":26023,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,3,5],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"日本で一番人気のある食べ物はラーメンです","edge":false,"segFrom":2,"segTo":3},{"id":"s7_26023","text":"I think because ramen has huge kinds of taste.","words":[{"w":"I","start":26023,"end":26190},{"w":"think","start":26190,"end":26690},{"w":"because","start":26690,"end":27357},{"w":"ramen","start":27357,"end":27857},{"w":"has","start":27857,"end":28190},{"w":"huge","start":28190,"end":28607},{"w":"kinds","start":28607,"end":29107},{"w":"of","start":29107,"end":29357},{"w":"taste.","start":29357,"end":29940}],"start":26023,"end":29940,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,4,7],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"ラーメンにはたくさんの味があるからだと思います","edge":false,"segFrom":3,"segTo":3},{"id":"s8_30820","text":"The message is clear and to the point.","words":[{"w":"The","start":30820,"end":31083},{"w":"message","start":31083,"end":31608},{"w":"is","start":31608,"end":31805},{"w":"clear","start":31805,"end":32198},{"w":"and","start":32198,"end":32461},{"w":"to","start":32461,"end":32658},{"w":"the","start":32658,"end":32920},{"w":"point.","start":32920,"end":33380}],"start":30820,"end":33380,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,4],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"そのメッセージは明確で要点を突いています","edge":false,"segFrom":4,"segTo":4},{"id":"s9_33380","text":"I lived in Japan for many years and love ramen as well.","words":[{"w":"I","start":33380,"end":33511},{"w":"lived","start":33511,"end":33905},{"w":"in","start":33905,"end":34102},{"w":"Japan","start":34102,"end":34495},{"w":"for","start":34495,"end":34758},{"w":"many","start":34758,"end":35086},{"w":"years","start":35086,"end":35480},{"w":"and","start":35480,"end":35814},{"w":"love","start":35814,"end":36231},{"w":"ramen","start":36231,"end":36731},{"w":"as","start":36731,"end":36982},{"w":"well.","start":36982,"end":37482}],"start":33380,"end":37482,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,4,7,10],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私は日本に何年も住んでいてラーメンも大好きです","edge":false,"segFrom":4,"segTo":5},{"id":"s10_37482","text":"We do have a couple of suggestions to improve the writing.","words":[{"w":"We","start":37482,"end":37733},{"w":"do","start":37733,"end":37983},{"w":"have","start":37983,"end":38400},{"w":"a","start":38400,"end":38567},{"w":"couple","start":38567,"end":39151},{"w":"of","start":39151,"end":39401},{"w":"suggestions","start":39401,"end":40402},{"w":"to","start":40402,"end":40653},{"w":"improve","start":40653,"end":41320},{"w":"the","start":41320,"end":41587},{"w":"writing.","start":41587,"end":42187}],"start":37482,"end":42187,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,3,7,9],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"書き方を改善するためのいくつかの提案があります","edge":false,"segFrom":5,"segTo":6},{"id":"s11_42187","text":"We need to pay special attention to short words such as articles and remove a few other words.","words":[{"w":"We","start":42187,"end":42387},{"w":"need","start":42387,"end":42720},{"w":"to","start":42720,"end":42920},{"w":"pay","start":42920,"end":43187},{"w":"special","start":43187,"end":43720},{"w":"attention","start":43720,"end":44387},{"w":"to","start":44387,"end":44587},{"w":"short","start":44587,"end":44987},{"w":"words","start":44987,"end":45387},{"w":"such","start":45387,"end":45720},{"w":"as","start":45720,"end":45920},{"w":"articles","start":45920,"end":46520},{"w":"and","start":46520,"end":46848},{"w":"remove","start":46848,"end":47422},{"w":"a","start":47422,"end":47586},{"w":"few","start":47586,"end":47914},{"w":"other","start":47914,"end":48405},{"w":"words.","start":48405,"end":48979}],"start":42187,"end":48979,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,6,9,12,14],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"短い単語である冠詞やほかのいくつかの単語を取り除く必要があります","edge":false,"segFrom":6,"segTo":7},{"id":"s12_48979","text":"For example, we need to include the word the at the beginning of the message, as in the most popular food in Japan is ramen.","words":[{"w":"For","start":48979,"end":49307},{"w":"example,","start":49307,"end":50045},{"w":"we","start":50045,"end":50291},{"w":"need","start":50291,"end":50701},{"w":"to","start":50701,"end":50946},{"w":"include","start":50946,"end":51602},{"w":"the","start":51602,"end":51930},{"w":"word","start":51930,"end":52340},{"w":"the","start":52340,"end":52646},{"w":"at","start":52646,"end":52875},{"w":"the","start":52875,"end":53181},{"w":"beginning","start":53181,"end":53946},{"w":"of","start":53946,"end":54176},{"w":"the","start":54176,"end":54482},{"w":"message,","start":54482,"end":55170},{"w":"as","start":55170,"end":55399},{"w":"in","start":55399,"end":55629},{"w":"the","start":55629,"end":55935},{"w":"most","start":55935,"end":56317},{"w":"popular","start":56317,"end":56929},{"w":"food","start":56929,"end":57312},{"w":"in","start":57312,"end":57541},{"w":"Japan","start":57541,"end":58000},{"w":"is","start":58000,"end":58214},{"w":"ramen.","start":58214,"end":58712}],"start":48979,"end":58712,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,6,9,15,17,23],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"例えば、私たちはメッセージの最初に the という単語を含める必要があります。例えば、日本で最も人気のある食べ物はラーメンです。","edge":false,"segFrom":7,"segTo":9},{"id":"s13_58712","text":"The reason we need to include the word the is because we often use articles to introduce a noun phrase.","words":[{"w":"The","start":58712,"end":58997},{"w":"reason","start":58997,"end":59496},{"w":"we","start":59496,"end":59710},{"w":"need","start":59710,"end":60066},{"w":"to","start":60066,"end":60279},{"w":"include","start":60279,"end":60849},{"w":"the","start":60849,"end":61134},{"w":"word","start":61134,"end":61490},{"w":"the","start":61490,"end":61775},{"w":"is","start":61775,"end":61989},{"w":"because","start":61989,"end":62559},{"w":"we","start":62559,"end":62773},{"w":"often","start":62773,"end":63200},{"w":"use","start":63200,"end":63532},{"w":"articles","start":63532,"end":64280},{"w":"to","start":64280,"end":64529},{"w":"introduce","start":64529,"end":65359},{"w":"a","start":65359,"end":65526},{"w":"noun","start":65526,"end":65941},{"w":"phrase.","start":65941,"end":66605}],"start":58712,"end":66605,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,6,9,11,15],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"私たちが the という単語を含める必要がある理由は、名詞句を導入するためにしばしば冠詞を使うからです。","edge":false,"segFrom":9,"segTo":10},{"id":"s14_66605","text":"English speakers expect a noun phrase to start with an article or other determiner.","words":[{"w":"English","start":66605,"end":67270},{"w":"speakers","start":67270,"end":68017},{"w":"expect","start":68017,"end":68599},{"w":"a","start":68599,"end":68765},{"w":"noun","start":68765,"end":69180},{"w":"phrase","start":69180,"end":69705},{"w":"to","start":69705,"end":69930},{"w":"start","start":69930,"end":70380},{"w":"with","start":70380,"end":70755},{"w":"an","start":70755,"end":70980},{"w":"article","start":70980,"end":71580},{"w":"or","start":71580,"end":71805},{"w":"other","start":71805,"end":72255},{"w":"determiner.","start":72255,"end":73155}],"start":66605,"end":73155,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,3,6,9],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"英語話者は、名詞句が冠詞や他の限定詞で始まることを期待します。","edge":false,"segFrom":10,"segTo":11},{"id":"s15_73155","text":"These short words are like signposts.","words":[{"w":"These","start":73155,"end":73605},{"w":"short","start":73605,"end":74055},{"w":"words","start":74055,"end":74505},{"w":"are","start":74505,"end":74805},{"w":"like","start":74805,"end":75180},{"w":"signposts.","start":75180,"end":75995}],"start":73155,"end":75995,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,3],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"これらの短い単語は、道標のようなものです。","edge":false,"segFrom":11,"segTo":12},{"id":"s16_75995","text":"They tell us what is coming or approaching.","words":[{"w":"They","start":75995,"end":76366},{"w":"tell","start":76366,"end":76736},{"w":"us","start":76736,"end":76958},{"w":"what","start":76958,"end":77329},{"w":"is","start":77329,"end":77551},{"w":"coming","start":77551,"end":78070},{"w":"or","start":78070,"end":78292},{"w":"approaching.","start":78292,"end":79256}],"start":75995,"end":79256,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,3,6],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"それらは、何が来るか、または近づいてくるかを教えてくれます。","edge":false,"segFrom":12,"segTo":12},{"id":"s17_79256","text":"A few words about huge kinds of taste.","words":[{"w":"A","start":79256,"end":79404},{"w":"few","start":79404,"end":79700},{"w":"words","start":79700,"end":80145},{"w":"about","start":80145,"end":80589},{"w":"huge","start":80589,"end":80960},{"w":"kinds","start":80960,"end":81427},{"w":"of","start":81427,"end":81661},{"w":"taste.","start":81661,"end":82206}],"start":79256,"end":82206,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,4],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"巨大な種類の味についてのいくつかの言葉。","edge":false,"segFrom":12,"segTo":13},{"id":"s18_82206","text":"While its meaning is understandable, English speakers might instead use different structures to express the same idea.","words":[{"w":"While","start":82206,"end":82674},{"w":"its","start":82674,"end":82985},{"w":"meaning","start":82985,"end":83608},{"w":"is","start":83608,"end":83842},{"w":"understandable,","start":83842,"end":85088},{"w":"English","start":85088,"end":85712},{"w":"speakers","start":85712,"end":86413},{"w":"might","start":86413,"end":86880},{"w":"instead","start":86880,"end":87533},{"w":"use","start":87533,"end":87860},{"w":"different","start":87860,"end":88677},{"w":"structures","start":88677,"end":89575},{"w":"to","start":89575,"end":89820},{"w":"express","start":89820,"end":90473},{"w":"the","start":90473,"end":90800},{"w":"same","start":90800,"end":91208},{"w":"idea.","start":91208,"end":91698}],"start":82206,"end":91698,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,5,12],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"意味は理解できるが、英語話者は同じことを表現するために異なる構造を使うかもしれない。","edge":false,"segFrom":13,"segTo":14},{"id":"s19_91698","text":"For example, English speakers might say that the taste is complex, bold, or rich.","words":[{"w":"For","start":91698,"end":92025},{"w":"example,","start":92025,"end":92760},{"w":"English","start":93260,"end":93912},{"w":"speakers","start":93912,"end":94645},{"w":"might","start":94645,"end":95133},{"w":"say","start":95133,"end":95459},{"w":"that","start":95459,"end":95866},{"w":"the","start":95866,"end":96192},{"w":"taste","start":96192,"end":96681},{"w":"is","start":96681,"end":96925},{"w":"complex,","start":96925,"end":97658},{"w":"bold,","start":97658,"end":98147},{"w":"or","start":98147,"end":98391},{"w":"rich.","start":98391,"end":98880}],"start":91698,"end":98880,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2,6,11,12],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"例えば、英語話者は味が複雑で、大胆で、豊かだと言うかもしれない。","edge":false,"segFrom":14,"segTo":15},{"id":"s20_98880","text":"So we might update the message so that it goes like this.","words":[{"w":"So","start":98880,"end":99165},{"w":"we","start":99165,"end":99451},{"w":"might","start":99451,"end":100022},{"w":"update","start":100022,"end":100688},{"w":"the","start":100688,"end":101069},{"w":"message","start":101069,"end":101830},{"w":"so","start":101830,"end":102115},{"w":"that","start":102115,"end":102591},{"w":"it","start":102591,"end":102877},{"w":"goes","start":102877,"end":103353},{"w":"like","start":103353,"end":103828},{"w":"this.","start":103828,"end":104399}],"start":98880,"end":104399,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,4,6],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"だから、メッセージを更新するかもしれない。","edge":false,"segFrom":16,"segTo":16},{"id":"s21_104399","text":"The most popular food in Japan is ramen because it has a rich, complex taste.","words":[{"w":"The","start":104399,"end":104780},{"w":"most","start":104780,"end":105168},{"w":"popular","start":105168,"end":105788},{"w":"food","start":105788,"end":106176},{"w":"in","start":106176,"end":106409},{"w":"Japan","start":106409,"end":106874},{"w":"is","start":106874,"end":107107},{"w":"ramen","start":107107,"end":107572},{"w":"because","start":107572,"end":108193},{"w":"it","start":108193,"end":108426},{"w":"has","start":108426,"end":108736},{"w":"a","start":108736,"end":108891},{"w":"rich,","start":108891,"end":109356},{"w":"complex","start":109356,"end":109977},{"w":"taste.","start":109977,"end":110520}],"start":104399,"end":110520,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,8,13],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"日本で最も人気のある食べ物はラーメンで、豊かで複雑な味があるからだ。","edge":false,"segFrom":16,"segTo":17},{"id":"s22_116420","text":"Here!","words":[{"w":"Here!","start":116420,"end":116618}],"start":116420,"end":116618,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"はい！","edge":false,"segFrom":18,"segTo":18},{"id":"s23_116618","text":"See you next time!","words":[{"w":"See","start":116618,"end":116750},{"w":"you","start":116750,"end":116882},{"w":"next","start":116882,"end":117047},{"w":"time!","start":117047,"end":117245}],"start":116618,"end":117245,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"またね！","edge":false,"segFrom":18,"segTo":18},{"id":"s24_117245","text":"Thank you!","words":[{"w":"Thank","start":117245,"end":117443},{"w":"you!","start":117443,"end":117609}],"start":117245,"end":117609,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"ありがとう！","edge":false,"segFrom":18,"segTo":18},{"id":"s25_117609","text":"To Be The Wealth Act.","words":[{"w":"To","start":117609,"end":117708},{"w":"Be","start":117708,"end":117807},{"w":"The","start":117807,"end":117939},{"w":"Wealth","start":117939,"end":118170},{"w":"Act.","start":118170,"end":118335}],"start":117609,"end":118335,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0,2],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"富を得る行為です。","edge":false,"segFrom":18,"segTo":18},{"id":"s26_118335","text":"Bye!","words":[{"w":"Bye!","start":118335,"end":118500}],"start":118335,"end":118500,"timing":"estimated","chunks":[0],"chunksByAi":true,"ja":"さようなら！","edge":false,"segFrom":18,"segTo":18}],"segments":[{"text":"Hi, Dr. Jill. Hi, John. What's on your mind today? We received","start":7100,"dur":5800},{"text":"a lot of messages from our audience around the world. One unnamed VOA Learning","start":12900,"dur":5580},{"text":"English fan sent us a message from Japan. Most popular food","start":18480,"dur":5960},{"text":"in Japan is ramen. I think because ramen has huge kinds of taste.","start":24440,"dur":5500},{"text":"The message is clear and to the point. I lived in Japan for many years","start":30820,"dur":4660},{"text":"and love ramen as well. We do have a couple of suggestions to improve","start":35480,"dur":5840},{"text":"the writing. We need to pay special attention to short words such as articles","start":41320,"dur":5200},{"text":"and remove a few other words. For example, we need to include the word","start":46520,"dur":5820},{"text":"the at the beginning of the message, as in the most popular food in Japan","start":52340,"dur":5660},{"text":"is ramen. The reason we need to include the word the is because we often","start":58000,"dur":5200},{"text":"use articles to introduce a noun phrase. English speakers expect a noun","start":63200,"dur":5980},{"text":"phrase to start with an article or other determiner. These short words are like","start":69180,"dur":6000},{"text":"signposts. They tell us what is coming or approaching. A few words about huge","start":75180,"dur":5780},{"text":"kinds of taste. While its meaning is understandable, English speakers might","start":80960,"dur":5920},{"text":"instead use different structures to express the same idea. For example,","start":86880,"dur":5880},{"text":"English speakers might say that the taste is complex, bold, or rich.","start":93260,"dur":5620},{"text":"So we might update the message so that it goes like this. The","start":98880,"dur":5900},{"text":"most popular food in Japan is ramen because it has a rich, complex taste.","start":104780,"dur":5740},{"text":"Here! See you next time! Thank you! To Be The Wealth Act. Bye!","start":116420,"dur":2080}],"analysisVersion":1,"punctuatedByAi":false,"createdAt":0,"updatedAt":0,"sample":{"level":"A2","topic":"日本のラーメン（文法の短い解説）","reason":"身近な話題で、比較や過去形などの基本文法。学習者向けの話し方（約 144 語/分）","wpm":144,"license":"パブリックドメイン（VOA Learning English）","credit":"VOA Learning English（learningenglish.voanews.com）","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q4PkX8_xUYk"}}